Description: Automated Do Not Disturb based on schedules and calendar events
 Smart DND automatically manages Do Not Disturb state on Linux desktops
 based on customizable time schedules and calendar events. Includes a
 modern Libadwaita GUI and support for Evolution Data Server, Caelestia,
 SwayNC, and Dunst.
